WEBVTT

01:30.870 --> 01:34.940
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.009 --> 01:37.940
[Episode 22]

01:38.289 --> 01:40.640
[Grand Vision for Long-Lasting Prosperity]

01:47.759 --> 01:48.479
Everyone,

01:49.590 --> 01:52.120
I behaved arrogantly and rudely
in Anhui before

01:52.120 --> 01:53.650
and offended Old Master Hu.

01:54.590 --> 01:55.680
Today Old Master Hu

01:55.710 --> 01:57.039
wants to apologize to me,

01:57.039 --> 01:57.640
and I'd also like to apologize

01:57.640 --> 01:58.910
to the entire

01:59.070 --> 02:01.070
Anhui Tea Merchants' Association.

02:04.710 --> 02:06.590
Old Master Hu is a man of noble character,

02:06.590 --> 02:07.990
and I respect him deeply.

02:09.080 --> 02:10.820
Let's turn the page

02:11.150 --> 02:12.960
on everything that happened before

02:12.960 --> 02:14.500
and not bring it up again.

02:15.590 --> 02:17.000
However, the gold-lettered plaque,

02:17.000 --> 02:18.120
"Top Tea Under Heaven,"

02:18.120 --> 02:19.120
belongs to Anhui,

02:19.360 --> 02:20.360
not to me alone,

02:21.030 --> 02:22.150
and it should hang in the hall

02:22.150 --> 02:24.480
of the Anhui Tea Merchants' Association.

02:25.400 --> 02:25.840
This

02:26.150 --> 02:27.329
is my first gift

02:27.400 --> 02:28.329
to Old Master Hu.

02:29.630 --> 02:30.630
My second gift

02:31.150 --> 02:33.210
is the recipe for our Orchid Snow tea.

02:33.310 --> 02:35.320
Old Master Hu, please accept it,

02:35.840 --> 02:36.710
make copies,

02:36.840 --> 02:39.640
and distribute them
to all tea merchants in Anhui.

02:40.310 --> 02:41.150
Mr. Gu,

02:41.520 --> 02:42.079
this...

02:42.360 --> 02:44.020
this gift is far too valuable.

02:44.120 --> 02:46.000
Not even a fortune could buy it.

02:46.280 --> 02:47.560
If you don't explain your reason,

02:47.560 --> 02:48.820
I cannot accept it.

02:49.400 --> 02:50.430
The reputation of Orchid Snow tea

02:50.430 --> 02:51.680
has already spread far and wide,

02:51.680 --> 02:52.700
but with just

02:52.870 --> 02:54.120
my brother and me

02:54.680 --> 02:55.590
and a few dozen mu

02:55.590 --> 02:56.750
of poor farmland,

02:57.030 --> 02:58.760
we can't produce much in a year.

03:00.080 --> 03:01.680
I'm afraid that in the future,

03:01.680 --> 03:03.430
all kinds of counterfeits

03:03.470 --> 03:04.930
might appear on the market

03:05.310 --> 03:06.840
and damage its reputation,

03:06.910 --> 03:07.400
and the blame

03:07.400 --> 03:10.330
would fall on
the Anhui Tea Merchants' Association.

03:10.680 --> 03:11.680
So, Old Master Hu,

03:11.870 --> 03:13.270
you must take this recipe

03:13.680 --> 03:14.540
no matter what.

03:15.280 --> 03:15.710
You...

03:16.710 --> 03:17.240
You...

03:17.630 --> 03:18.640
You left me

03:18.710 --> 03:20.310
no room to refuse.

03:22.400 --> 03:23.680
Mr. Gu, rest assured.

03:23.800 --> 03:26.050
If the Gu family's Orchid Snow tea

03:26.079 --> 03:27.800
becomes popular throughout the land,

03:27.800 --> 03:30.090
it will be thanks to you.

03:30.190 --> 03:33.390
The Anhui Tea Merchants' Association
is at your service.

03:34.460 --> 03:35.990
I can't take this position.

03:36.840 --> 03:37.910
You see, I'm the kind of person

03:37.910 --> 03:39.120
who can't stand hassles.

03:39.120 --> 03:40.590
I'm used to an easy, leisurely life.

03:40.590 --> 03:41.750
Looking after my tea plantation,

03:41.750 --> 03:42.560
free and easy,

03:42.750 --> 03:43.810
suits me just fine.

03:44.150 --> 03:46.280
You should be the one in this position.

03:47.470 --> 03:49.270
Mr. Gu, you're being too modest.

03:49.310 --> 03:50.800
I'm not being modest at all.

03:50.800 --> 03:52.130
In these chaotic times,

03:52.280 --> 03:53.560
hundreds of thousands of tea farmers
in Anhui

03:53.560 --> 03:54.960
are suffering terribly.

03:54.960 --> 03:55.750
I think

03:56.400 --> 03:57.800
Orchid Snow tea

03:57.840 --> 03:59.310
might be our one ray of hope.

03:59.310 --> 04:00.520
If we can

04:00.520 --> 04:01.450
promote this tea

04:01.470 --> 04:02.440
successfully,

04:02.470 --> 04:03.520
the people of Anhui

04:03.520 --> 04:04.720
can live more easily.

04:05.400 --> 04:06.150
This would be a great deed

04:06.150 --> 04:08.480
of the Anhui Tea Merchants' Association.

04:22.089 --> 04:29.260
[Benefiting the Local Community]

04:30.950 --> 04:32.210
This time, Gu

04:34.190 --> 04:36.060
has restored the honor

04:36.159 --> 04:37.420
of the people of Anhui.

04:39.600 --> 04:41.240
In the future, please put in

04:41.270 --> 04:43.890
a good word for me in front of him.

04:44.750 --> 04:45.900
Me?

04:46.950 --> 04:48.090
If it weren't for Gu,

04:48.240 --> 04:49.800
could our tea

04:50.070 --> 04:51.900
have sold for such good prices?

04:52.310 --> 04:53.480
Thank you, Mr. Gu.

04:53.950 --> 04:54.810
Think about it—

04:55.070 --> 04:56.520
Silver Bud—

04:56.630 --> 04:57.730
what a rustic name.

04:57.830 --> 04:58.620
Orchid Snow?

04:58.870 --> 05:00.070
That's just perfect,

05:00.160 --> 05:00.870
isn't it?

05:00.780 --> 05:02.790
[Benefiting the Local Community]

05:01.040 --> 05:02.360
Yes!

05:05.480 --> 05:07.160
From now on, call him Second Master!

05:07.160 --> 05:08.490
Call him Second Master!

05:09.800 --> 05:10.360
Alright.

05:10.360 --> 05:12.220
-Second Master.
-Second Master.

05:28.560 --> 05:30.900
It's so boring on the march.

05:31.040 --> 05:33.250
I prepared for it in advance.

05:36.270 --> 05:36.870
Mr. Gu.

05:37.680 --> 05:39.310
How did those Anhui tea merchants

05:39.310 --> 05:41.370
kowtow and admit their faults to you?

05:41.630 --> 05:43.560
You must not let them off easily.

05:44.730 --> 05:46.750
Thinking about it,
I was too young back then,

05:46.750 --> 05:48.270
insisting on making this Orchid Snow tea.

05:48.270 --> 05:49.730
I can't really blame them.

05:50.310 --> 05:51.920
You were simply lucky.

05:52.470 --> 05:54.750
Who else in this world
walks out their door

05:54.750 --> 05:56.680
and runs into the Empress Dowager?

05:56.750 --> 05:58.110
And who else

05:58.159 --> 05:59.950
could earn her favor,

06:00.000 --> 06:01.270
with a single word from her

06:01.270 --> 06:02.870
turning everything around?

06:05.610 --> 06:06.720
Why do you think His Highness

06:06.720 --> 06:07.830
was so accommodating?

06:07.830 --> 06:08.870
He had no choice.

06:09.390 --> 06:11.070
That plaque granted by the Empress Dowager

06:11.070 --> 06:12.870
has him completely pinned down.

06:15.480 --> 06:17.360
When you invited me to that banquet,

06:17.360 --> 06:18.360
that was also
at the Empress Dowager's behest,

06:18.360 --> 06:19.000
wasn't it?

06:21.270 --> 06:22.200
Of course.

06:23.310 --> 06:24.000
However,

06:24.160 --> 06:24.920
I didn't bask

06:24.990 --> 06:26.680
in your glory for nothing.

06:26.870 --> 06:27.800
After we take Hefei,

06:27.800 --> 06:30.330
the credit
will be split between the two of us.

06:30.560 --> 06:33.250
Even if we have
to kill everyone in the city,

06:34.070 --> 06:35.430
I won't hesitate.

06:43.000 --> 06:43.830
Mr. Gu,

06:44.920 --> 06:46.240
this is the kind of luck

06:46.270 --> 06:48.190
that doesn't come once in centuries.

06:48.190 --> 06:50.750
Our dynasty rewards military merit
faster than anything.

06:50.750 --> 06:52.310
With an opportunity like this,

06:52.310 --> 06:53.990
you'll rise swiftly.

06:54.120 --> 06:55.470
You're a scholar.

06:55.600 --> 06:57.260
You should know this clearly.

06:57.640 --> 06:58.800
Since ancient times,

06:58.800 --> 07:00.560
it's been made very clear—

07:01.870 --> 07:03.260
a head taken

07:03.480 --> 07:04.310
is

07:04.920 --> 07:06.000
a rank gained.

07:09.270 --> 07:10.000
Come on.

07:10.120 --> 07:10.480
Here.

07:49.800 --> 07:50.480
Ms. Su.

07:51.870 --> 07:53.360
You'd better not go outside.

07:53.360 --> 07:54.870
My people are everywhere out there.

07:54.870 --> 07:55.930
Without my orders,

07:56.000 --> 07:57.040
if anyone suddenly sees you coming out,

07:57.040 --> 07:58.300
you'll lose your head.

08:04.320 --> 08:05.120
You really do look like

08:05.120 --> 08:06.250
a high official now.

08:07.070 --> 08:09.930
Pacification Commissioner
of the imperial court.

08:11.030 --> 08:12.070
How did you know?

08:13.160 --> 08:14.000
Did you plant people

08:14.000 --> 08:15.200
around Qiao Song too?

08:15.750 --> 08:17.680
We were planning to kill Qiao Song,

08:19.240 --> 08:20.000
but then we suddenly learned

08:20.000 --> 08:20.750
that he brought someone

08:20.750 --> 08:21.920
even the Empress Dowager

08:21.920 --> 08:23.000
valued.

08:23.510 --> 08:25.040
I was wondering who that could be.

08:25.040 --> 08:26.240
So it's an old friend.

08:27.560 --> 08:28.480
You came all this way

08:28.480 --> 08:30.340
just to bring your head back to me.

08:30.560 --> 08:31.820
What a waste of effort.

08:32.630 --> 08:33.870
I'm no friend to you.

08:34.720 --> 08:35.640
I'm a dead man.

08:36.390 --> 08:37.200
That's right.

08:38.000 --> 08:39.030
Keeping someone like you around

08:39.030 --> 08:40.360
would only get in my way.

08:41.120 --> 08:41.669
Tell me,

08:42.549 --> 08:44.290
do you have any last wishes

08:44.320 --> 08:45.440
or messages?

08:48.440 --> 08:50.100
I want you to persuade Li Cheng

08:50.750 --> 08:52.810
that Hefei can no longer be defended.

08:53.000 --> 08:54.460
Tell him to withdraw early

08:55.000 --> 08:55.600
and not drag down

08:55.600 --> 08:57.270
the innocent people of the city.

08:57.270 --> 08:59.000
And I'd also like to remind you:

08:59.720 --> 09:01.840
when a great structure is collapsing,
a single beam can't hold it up.

09:01.840 --> 09:02.910
Your schemes

09:03.440 --> 09:04.900
won't amount to anything.

09:05.150 --> 09:06.150
You won't win.

09:17.120 --> 09:18.000
You still can't change

09:18.000 --> 09:19.530
that sharp tongue of yours.

09:20.200 --> 09:21.510
Aren't you afraid of dying?

09:21.510 --> 09:22.000
I am.

09:22.910 --> 09:23.670
Aren't you?

09:25.840 --> 09:26.820
Since I

09:27.150 --> 09:28.550
ruined your plans before

09:29.550 --> 09:31.150
and you almost got me killed,

09:31.600 --> 09:32.890
I'd say we're even now.

09:33.440 --> 09:34.700
Time to talk business.

09:35.910 --> 09:38.110
I didn't expect you to be a businessman.

09:40.960 --> 09:41.760
I want every

09:41.790 --> 09:43.320
innocent civilian in Hefei

09:43.480 --> 09:44.510
to survive.

09:46.270 --> 09:47.470
Can we make that deal?

09:48.260 --> 09:49.290
Go tell Li Cheng

09:49.440 --> 09:50.020
that Hefei is now

09:50.020 --> 09:51.500
surrounded on three sides.

09:51.500 --> 09:53.760
He still has one last chance of survival.

09:56.510 --> 09:58.240
Even heroes can't escape love.

09:58.960 --> 10:00.630
You're still thinking about Miss Bai,
aren't you?

10:00.630 --> 10:02.360
I'm not doing this for Miss Bai.

10:02.670 --> 10:04.510
I'm doing this for all the citizens.

10:04.510 --> 10:06.040
A real man does what he must.

10:06.440 --> 10:08.500
You've severely underestimated me.

10:11.030 --> 10:12.240
You want him to withdraw,

10:12.240 --> 10:13.300
but where can he go?

10:13.360 --> 10:14.240
Under the walls of Jinling,

10:14.240 --> 10:16.200
the court's northern
and southern camps are stationed.

10:16.200 --> 10:18.240
There are troops in the Zhejiang region
as well.

10:18.240 --> 10:19.120
As for Suzhou,

10:19.550 --> 10:20.670
it depends on whether the prince there

10:20.670 --> 10:22.070
is willing to take him in.

10:22.390 --> 10:23.930
So we must work together.

10:24.600 --> 10:26.060
You help him plan a way out.

10:26.320 --> 10:27.550
Whatever you need from me,

10:27.550 --> 10:28.610
I'll do my best.

10:32.200 --> 10:32.720
I can't believe

10:32.720 --> 10:34.850
you still dare to speak to me like this.

10:43.600 --> 10:45.400
I'll remember your life for now.

10:45.630 --> 10:46.890
I'll come back for you.

11:06.030 --> 11:08.480
Greetings, Lord Gu!

11:06.480 --> 11:08.500
[Hefei, Qing Army Station]

11:11.110 --> 11:11.810
Mr. Gu,

11:12.120 --> 11:13.050
act just like me.

11:13.150 --> 11:14.030
If you treat them well

11:14.030 --> 11:15.340
and see them as equals,

11:15.440 --> 11:17.030
they'll only walk all over you.

11:17.030 --> 11:18.860
That's how the bureaucracy works.

11:18.860 --> 11:19.530
Mr. Qiao,

11:19.600 --> 11:20.930
I'm hardly an official.

11:21.320 --> 11:22.270
I don't need to learn those tricks, do I?

11:22.270 --> 11:24.440
Lords, you must be tired

11:24.510 --> 11:25.870
from the long journey.

11:26.630 --> 11:27.910
Greetings, Pacification Commissioner.

11:27.910 --> 11:28.640
Mr. Bao Qing,

11:28.910 --> 11:29.960
I'm not an official.

11:29.960 --> 11:31.440
You don't need to salute me.

11:31.440 --> 11:32.300
How can that be?

11:32.910 --> 11:34.550
Mr. Gu,
you are the Pacification Commissioner,

11:34.550 --> 11:36.870
personally appointed
by the Empress Dowager.

11:36.870 --> 11:39.000
That's far above my rank

11:39.030 --> 11:40.600
as a fourth-rank military attaché.

11:40.600 --> 11:42.550
How dare I break imperial protocol?

11:42.550 --> 11:43.510
Come on.

11:43.630 --> 11:44.150
Please.

11:44.550 --> 11:46.750
The food and wine are already prepared.

11:48.910 --> 11:49.510
Music!

11:52.200 --> 11:53.270
Come on, everyone.

11:53.600 --> 11:54.980
Let's toast to Mr. Qiao.

11:55.910 --> 11:57.000
Mr. Qiao's arrival

11:57.200 --> 11:59.810
is like the rising sun driving away evil.

12:00.000 --> 12:01.120
The siege has lasted so long,

12:01.120 --> 12:03.150
and today we finally see hope.

12:04.960 --> 12:06.960
With the Pacification Commissioner here,

12:06.960 --> 12:09.840
the local people feel
as if blessed with a new parent.

12:09.840 --> 12:11.670
The banners and umbrellas of gratitude

12:11.670 --> 12:13.150
are too many to count.

12:13.200 --> 12:16.030
The Empress Dowager's
exceptional promotion of you

12:16.030 --> 12:17.490
couldn't be more fitting.

12:17.510 --> 12:18.590
We would also like to toast you.

12:18.590 --> 12:19.110
Wait.

12:19.440 --> 12:21.200
What banners and umbrellas of gratitude?

12:21.200 --> 12:22.360
I haven't done anything.

12:22.360 --> 12:24.090
How could there be such things?

12:31.620 --> 12:33.150
You guys are so good at this.

12:33.440 --> 12:34.750
Of course.

12:34.790 --> 12:36.120
We had to prepare early.

12:36.120 --> 12:36.870
You can't really wait

12:36.870 --> 12:39.600
for the commoners
to bring these things, can you?

12:40.440 --> 12:41.170
Mr. Bao Qing,

12:41.440 --> 12:42.600
there's one thing I don't understand.

12:42.600 --> 12:44.000
I'd like to ask you about it.

12:44.000 --> 12:45.510
Please, Pacification Commissioner.

12:45.510 --> 12:47.710
I heard Hefei is about to run out of food.

12:48.150 --> 12:48.670
When are you planning

12:48.670 --> 12:49.930
to launch the assault?

12:55.390 --> 12:57.510
We were waiting for your order.

12:57.720 --> 13:00.000
As soon as you command it,
I'll marshal the troops and attack.

13:00.000 --> 13:01.510
I don't understand military affairs.

13:01.510 --> 13:02.570
I'm just saying—

13:02.750 --> 13:04.550
if you keep the siege going like this,

13:04.550 --> 13:05.360
the people inside the city

13:05.360 --> 13:06.600
really will starve to death.

13:06.600 --> 13:07.720
That's nothing to worry about.

13:07.720 --> 13:09.840
Only when those traitors

13:09.870 --> 13:11.860
are too hungry to lift their swords

13:12.120 --> 13:14.180
can we achieve victory in one battle.

13:18.270 --> 13:19.120
Remind me—

13:19.600 --> 13:20.810
what is my post again?

13:20.840 --> 13:21.770
I've forgotten.

13:22.390 --> 13:24.030
You're the Pacification Commissioner.

13:24.030 --> 13:25.670
So does what I say carry weight?

13:25.670 --> 13:26.550
Of course.

13:27.120 --> 13:27.870
When you first arrived,

13:27.870 --> 13:28.700
I said

13:28.760 --> 13:30.990
everything would follow your command.

13:31.240 --> 13:32.200
That is how the court

13:32.200 --> 13:35.080
shows its care for the people
and its defense of the realm.

13:35.080 --> 13:36.790
Right, exactly.

13:36.910 --> 13:38.270
In that case,

13:38.320 --> 13:39.360
if you starve everyone to death,

13:39.360 --> 13:40.890
who am I supposed to pacify?

13:44.510 --> 13:45.440
Or...

13:45.840 --> 13:47.840
are you trying to take my job from me?

13:48.600 --> 13:49.350
Besides,

13:49.720 --> 13:51.510
most of those so‑called enemy troops

13:51.510 --> 13:53.000
are actually

13:53.030 --> 13:53.790
common folk in Hefei

13:53.790 --> 13:55.320
who were dragged into this.

13:55.720 --> 13:56.440
If they end up

13:56.440 --> 13:57.480
starved to death by you,

13:57.480 --> 13:58.150
or cut down

13:58.200 --> 13:59.320
by your swords,

13:59.510 --> 14:00.600
wouldn't that tarnish

14:00.600 --> 14:02.660
the Empress Dowager's benevolence?

14:02.870 --> 14:04.030
Have you

14:04.200 --> 14:06.330
ever seriously thought this through?

14:11.030 --> 14:11.720
Mr. Gu,

14:12.000 --> 14:12.930
I truly admire

14:13.030 --> 14:14.440
what you just said.

14:15.080 --> 14:15.870
I think

14:16.270 --> 14:18.380
they've been starved long enough.

14:18.960 --> 14:21.580
It's time we attack.

14:21.910 --> 14:22.320
Right.

14:22.910 --> 14:23.550
Mr. Qiao,

14:24.080 --> 14:25.340
I've made my decision.

14:25.390 --> 14:27.520
I'll go home to inform my family first.

14:27.550 --> 14:28.280
In a few days,

14:28.550 --> 14:30.150
I will personally go to Hefei

14:30.240 --> 14:31.510
to persuade them to surrender.

14:31.510 --> 14:32.320
That won't do.

14:32.720 --> 14:34.320
If anything happens to you,

14:34.390 --> 14:35.840
I don't have enough heads

14:35.960 --> 14:36.960
to pay for it.

14:37.310 --> 14:38.110
Rest assured.

14:38.550 --> 14:39.750
Once this battle is over,

14:39.750 --> 14:41.320
I'll make sure your military merits
are recorded

14:41.320 --> 14:43.320
and that you're granted an official post.

14:43.320 --> 14:44.190
Mr. Bao Qing,

14:44.270 --> 14:46.000
how could you forget what you just said?

14:46.000 --> 14:49.630
"everything would follow
Pacification Commissioner's command."

14:49.630 --> 14:51.000
"That is how the imperial court"

14:51.000 --> 14:54.330
"shows its care for the people
and its defense of the realm."

15:02.760 --> 15:03.820
I'll head back now.

15:05.390 --> 15:05.850
Well...

15:08.200 --> 15:11.590
[Marshal]

15:09.150 --> 15:11.490
Pacification Commissioner.

15:11.670 --> 15:13.530
Pacification Commissioner.

15:21.910 --> 15:22.600
Qiao,

15:23.960 --> 15:26.490
this Mr. Gu is indeed
cut out to be an official.

15:28.670 --> 15:31.870
That's what you get
for being so careless with your words.

15:31.870 --> 15:33.330
How was I supposed to know?

15:33.480 --> 15:34.540
He learned so fast.

15:34.840 --> 15:37.240
With just a few lines,
he had me speechless.

15:38.600 --> 15:40.060
Don't underestimate him.

15:40.790 --> 15:41.670
We'd better

15:42.240 --> 15:43.940
not offend men like him.

15:47.960 --> 15:49.080
Why do you think the Empress Dowager

15:49.080 --> 15:50.200
suddenly gave him
the title of Pacification Commissioner

15:50.200 --> 15:51.480
out of nowhere?

15:51.840 --> 15:52.480
Why?

15:55.270 --> 15:56.880
She's long been displeased

15:56.910 --> 15:58.790
with the Sixth Prince.

15:59.360 --> 16:01.360
You and I both work for His Highness.

16:01.550 --> 16:02.270
So she gave Gu

16:02.270 --> 16:04.870
a nominal post
as Pacification Commissioner.

16:05.360 --> 16:06.720
Though it's just a nominal post,

16:06.720 --> 16:08.720
if you dare to disobey his orders,

16:09.880 --> 16:11.480
that becomes a real problem.

16:12.960 --> 16:13.480
Also,

16:14.630 --> 16:16.480
You must

16:16.510 --> 16:17.940
keep him here.

16:18.240 --> 16:19.000
Why?

16:20.320 --> 16:22.580
Who gets the credit if he achieves merit?

16:24.720 --> 16:26.940
And if he causes trouble—

16:27.080 --> 16:28.140
who will be blamed?

16:32.670 --> 16:33.480
You are wise.

16:35.670 --> 16:36.840
But there's one thing

16:36.840 --> 16:38.300
I still don't understand.

16:38.480 --> 16:40.240
Since we're holding him in high regard

16:40.240 --> 16:41.970
and giving him credit for free,

16:42.030 --> 16:42.830
why is he still insisting on

16:42.830 --> 16:43.670
going into the city
to persuade them to surrender?

16:43.670 --> 16:45.030
That's a suicide mission.

16:45.030 --> 16:46.360
Why didn't you stop him?

16:46.480 --> 16:47.360
Did you try to stop him?

16:47.360 --> 16:48.080
I did.

16:48.080 --> 16:48.570
And?

16:48.670 --> 16:49.550
I couldn't stop him.

16:49.550 --> 16:51.840
Then he's choosing death himself.

16:51.910 --> 16:52.910
Nothing we can do.

16:52.910 --> 16:55.750
He's the Pacification Commissioner.

16:55.840 --> 16:58.160
That's his duty.

17:00.650 --> 17:04.490
[Gu's Mansion]

17:18.030 --> 17:19.480
Why aren't you wearing the tiger skin?

17:19.160 --> 17:22.800
[Blessings and Auspiciousness]

17:19.920 --> 17:20.720
I waited half the night

17:20.720 --> 17:22.430
hoping to see you in it.

17:23.579 --> 17:25.310
Pingyuan, you know the Empress Dowager.

17:25.310 --> 17:26.640
Why don't you talk to her?

17:26.640 --> 17:27.680
You don't want to be an official anyway.

17:27.680 --> 17:28.480
Get me

17:28.510 --> 17:29.640
a tiger skin to wear.

17:29.790 --> 17:31.440
Just imagine me
walking around the village—

17:31.440 --> 17:32.700
how majestic I'd look.

17:34.680 --> 17:36.480
What do you need a tiger skin for?

17:36.880 --> 17:38.070
When I was chased by wolves
beyond the pass,

17:38.070 --> 17:39.790
I didn't see you coming to save me.

17:39.790 --> 17:41.160
All you ever do is borrow my power.

17:41.160 --> 17:42.220
You're so heartless.

17:42.220 --> 17:43.070
I searched everywhere for you.

17:43.070 --> 17:43.480
I can't even remember

17:43.480 --> 17:44.740
how many times I cried.

17:48.240 --> 17:49.900
Try to be stronger from now on.

17:50.270 --> 17:51.670
Stop crying all the time.

17:53.960 --> 17:55.450
Pingyuan, seriously—

17:55.550 --> 17:56.500
someone's offering you an official post.

17:56.500 --> 17:57.720
Why won't you take it?

17:58.790 --> 18:00.480
Enough.
Don't talk to me about being an official.

18:00.480 --> 18:01.680
I'm already annoyed.

18:02.350 --> 18:03.160
They say,
"Even the prime minister's relatives"

18:03.160 --> 18:04.060
"hold seventh-rank posts."

18:04.060 --> 18:05.400
If you became an official,

18:05.400 --> 18:06.920
I could become a magistrate.

18:06.920 --> 18:08.070
Anyone who dares disobey me,

18:08.070 --> 18:08.790
I'd slam the table

18:08.790 --> 18:09.720
and have them punished.

18:09.720 --> 18:10.250
Get lost!

18:19.350 --> 18:19.960
Mother,

18:20.480 --> 18:21.160
I'm back.

18:21.880 --> 18:22.940
If you're resting,

18:23.160 --> 18:25.030
I'll come pay my respects in the morning.

18:25.030 --> 18:25.790
Come in.

18:37.510 --> 18:39.720
Pingwen said you almost lost your life.

18:41.310 --> 18:42.510
I was scared to death.

18:43.880 --> 18:45.880
A friend dragged me beyond the pass.

18:45.880 --> 18:46.740
I left in a hurry

18:47.310 --> 18:48.030
and didn't have time

18:48.030 --> 18:48.960
to tell Pingwen.

18:50.310 --> 18:51.510
I don't believe that.

18:54.200 --> 18:55.400
Mother, I promise you

18:56.000 --> 18:58.310
I won't go that far away again.

19:02.350 --> 19:02.880
Mother,

19:03.510 --> 19:05.110
I have some good news for you.

19:05.240 --> 19:06.640
This time in the capital,

19:06.680 --> 19:08.700
I handed a note to Sixth Prince.

19:09.200 --> 19:10.640
He promised to have people

19:10.640 --> 19:12.240
in Nine Gates Infantry Commander's Office

19:12.240 --> 19:13.700
help me look for my father.

19:14.520 --> 19:15.180
If even they

19:15.200 --> 19:16.130
cannot find him,

19:16.480 --> 19:18.140
then he really can't be found.

19:18.550 --> 19:19.680
Don't be too upset.

19:20.810 --> 19:22.000
I'm not upset.

19:23.840 --> 19:24.960
I just can't help

19:25.000 --> 19:26.750
holding onto a small hope.

19:28.390 --> 19:29.940
I just feel like he's

19:30.030 --> 19:31.510
still alive somewhere.

19:33.400 --> 19:34.480
If he is,

19:35.750 --> 19:36.880
knowing that you

19:37.470 --> 19:39.470
and his two sons are waiting at home,

19:39.750 --> 19:41.210
how could he not come back?

19:42.880 --> 19:44.610
Please don't say that anymore.

19:44.750 --> 19:46.150
It only brings more pain.

19:48.310 --> 19:49.620
If you're safe,

19:50.270 --> 19:51.480
and if you have the chance,

19:51.480 --> 19:53.360
continue searching for him.

19:54.720 --> 19:55.800
Even if he's dead,

19:56.310 --> 19:58.510
at least I'll be able to cry at his grave,

19:59.550 --> 20:01.150
and that would give me peace.

20:03.640 --> 20:04.700
I'm going to sleep.

20:13.350 --> 20:15.150
I'm not going anywhere tonight.

20:15.480 --> 20:17.140
I'll stay right here with you.

20:18.190 --> 20:18.900
Sleep well.

20:31.990 --> 20:35.940
[Hefei City]

20:42.400 --> 20:45.460
I am Gu Pingyuan,
Pacification Commissioner of Anhui.

20:45.910 --> 20:47.570
I want to see General Li Cheng!

21:32.350 --> 21:33.030
Yimei.

21:34.720 --> 21:35.720
How have you been?

21:39.070 --> 21:40.000
Why are you here?

21:40.640 --> 21:42.100
Am I not allowed to be here?

21:44.310 --> 21:45.830
I didn't know you had become

21:45.830 --> 21:47.690
the Pacification Commissioner.

21:50.830 --> 21:52.160
Life is unpredictable.

21:53.000 --> 21:53.880
Who can guarantee

21:53.880 --> 21:55.740
what role they'll play tomorrow?

21:56.570 --> 21:58.230
Yesterday you were Bai Yimei,

21:58.830 --> 22:01.000
and today you're playing
the Princess Consort, aren't you?

22:01.000 --> 22:02.800
I can never win a debate with you.

22:03.590 --> 22:04.310
Tell me,

22:05.030 --> 22:05.960
why are you here?

22:06.550 --> 22:08.030
Tell me and then just leave.

22:08.030 --> 22:09.430
This is a dangerous city.

22:10.030 --> 22:11.230
I need to see Li Cheng.

22:13.680 --> 22:16.480
He's busy with military affairs
and won't see you.

22:16.720 --> 22:18.110
If there's nothing else, just go now.

22:18.110 --> 22:20.370
What military affairs do you still have?

22:20.720 --> 22:21.550
Right now in Hefei,

22:21.550 --> 22:22.750
people are starving.

22:23.720 --> 22:25.850
If you don't escape now, when will you?

22:26.160 --> 22:29.090
Do you want to drag everyone in the city
down with you?

22:31.480 --> 22:32.270
You really do

22:32.290 --> 22:33.950
speak for the imperial court.

22:34.640 --> 22:35.270
Yimei,

22:36.640 --> 22:38.130
now that you are a Princess Consort,

22:38.130 --> 22:39.730
your heart has hardened too?

22:40.720 --> 22:43.580
Do you really want that many people
buried with you?

22:44.680 --> 22:46.270
Why make things difficult for me?

22:46.270 --> 22:47.030
I'm not.

22:48.440 --> 22:49.370
I'm begging you.

22:50.260 --> 22:51.090
Even if you choose

22:51.090 --> 22:52.550
to go down a dead‑end path,

22:53.310 --> 22:55.770
at least
spare the innocent people of Hefei.

22:56.070 --> 22:57.600
Leave them a chance to live.

22:59.740 --> 23:00.350
If Mr. Bai

23:00.400 --> 23:01.790
saw you like this,

23:02.920 --> 23:04.320
he would be heartbroken.

23:07.240 --> 23:07.980
Gu,

23:08.640 --> 23:10.500
you can't talk about me like that.

23:10.510 --> 23:11.770
Even if I wanted to leave,

23:11.770 --> 23:13.500
this isn't my decision to make.

23:17.720 --> 23:18.920
What's going on here?

23:24.110 --> 23:25.500
How come you two old friends are arguing

23:25.500 --> 23:26.750
the moment you meet?

23:27.790 --> 23:28.930
What he just said

23:29.200 --> 23:30.640
was for our own good.

23:33.000 --> 23:33.800
Brew some tea.

23:41.400 --> 23:42.000
Please.

23:49.590 --> 23:50.990
In these circumstances,

23:52.400 --> 23:53.020
this is the best

23:53.020 --> 23:54.550
I can offer you.

24:06.550 --> 24:07.470
Is this

24:08.110 --> 24:09.440
what you're eating now?

24:09.750 --> 24:11.280
This is good stuff.

24:12.720 --> 24:13.880
I tore out the gardens
in the Prince's Mansion—

24:13.880 --> 24:14.750
front and back—

24:15.110 --> 24:16.710
and planted a lot of peanuts.

24:17.920 --> 24:19.250
I haven't asked you yet—

24:19.960 --> 24:21.650
should I call you Gu,

24:22.110 --> 24:24.000
or Lord Gu now?

24:25.590 --> 24:26.990
Just call me Gu Pingyuan.

24:29.720 --> 24:30.720
It was petty of me.

24:32.400 --> 24:33.400
My apologies, Gu.

24:38.430 --> 24:39.310
I'm here today for...

24:39.310 --> 24:41.030
I heard the title
"Pacification Commissioner"

24:41.030 --> 24:42.550
just now when I got here.

24:44.070 --> 24:44.680
Good.

24:45.240 --> 24:45.920
Very good.

24:48.070 --> 24:49.280
In this entire world,

24:49.310 --> 24:51.960
among all the civil
and military officials of the Qing court—

24:51.960 --> 24:53.640
plus that old emperor—

24:53.920 --> 24:54.800
not one of them

24:54.830 --> 24:56.030
deserves that title.

24:56.200 --> 24:57.160
But you...

24:57.920 --> 24:59.380
you're the perfect person

24:59.830 --> 25:01.030
for it.

25:02.960 --> 25:04.110
Now that you're here,

25:04.110 --> 25:05.510
it puts my mind at ease.

25:08.160 --> 25:09.090
Oh right, Yimei.

25:10.960 --> 25:12.070
Go to the storeroom.

25:12.070 --> 25:13.310
There's a good bottle of wine

25:13.310 --> 25:14.510
under the blade rack.

25:14.510 --> 25:15.310
Bring it here.

25:15.590 --> 25:17.190
I want to have a drink with Gu.

25:18.070 --> 25:19.790
You haven't eaten anything yet.

25:19.790 --> 25:20.720
We have peanuts.

25:21.350 --> 25:21.830
Go on.

25:30.050 --> 25:31.980
Given the state of Hefei right now,

25:32.160 --> 25:32.880
Gu,

25:33.200 --> 25:34.800
do you have any advice for me?

25:36.810 --> 25:37.750
Hefei is now surrounded

25:37.750 --> 25:38.670
on three sides.

25:39.750 --> 25:41.080
Why don't you withdraw?

25:42.070 --> 25:45.200
Once you cross the Yangtze River,
you'll reach Jinling.

25:45.830 --> 25:46.510
It seems

25:46.530 --> 25:48.070
you really haven't been in office
for long.

25:48.070 --> 25:48.550
Yes.

25:50.920 --> 25:51.920
If we leave Hefei,

25:52.510 --> 25:53.370
where can we go?

25:54.350 --> 25:54.960
Zhejiang?

25:55.880 --> 25:58.410
The regime's troops there
are waiting for us.

25:58.440 --> 25:59.070
Suzhou?

26:00.110 --> 26:00.880
My old brothers

26:00.880 --> 26:02.160
won't agree to that.

26:04.240 --> 26:05.310
Jinling?

26:08.300 --> 26:09.300
Outside Jinling,

26:09.400 --> 26:12.600
there are hundreds of thousands
of troops in the north and south camps.

26:12.600 --> 26:14.460
Even if I fight my way into the city

26:15.200 --> 26:16.750
and sit with my brothers,

26:16.790 --> 26:17.590
my end...

26:18.240 --> 26:19.480
may be even worse.

26:20.510 --> 26:21.000
Why?

26:23.960 --> 26:24.980
Do you know about Jinling's

26:24.980 --> 26:26.110
current situation?

26:26.480 --> 26:27.160
I don't.

26:31.160 --> 26:33.620
My brothers are fighting among themselves.

26:34.030 --> 26:36.360
The crisis will unfold
in a matter of days.

26:40.090 --> 26:41.510
Our death is near.

27:18.550 --> 27:19.290
Gu,

27:20.820 --> 27:22.020
this toast is for you.

27:22.550 --> 27:23.880
You were right earlier.

27:24.870 --> 27:25.790
I shouldn't drag

27:25.790 --> 27:27.830
everyone in Hefei down with me.

27:29.750 --> 27:31.810
After this drink, you should go back.

27:31.920 --> 27:32.980
Tomorrow morning,

27:33.200 --> 27:35.110
I'll open the gates and let the people go,

27:35.110 --> 27:36.920
without harming a single soul.

27:39.310 --> 27:40.550
As for my wife and me—

27:42.030 --> 27:43.550
we will repay your great kindness

27:43.550 --> 27:44.550
in our next life.

27:45.480 --> 27:46.200
Gu,

27:46.590 --> 27:48.190
I'd like to toast you as well.

27:48.350 --> 27:49.580
I was rude earlier.

27:49.790 --> 27:50.850
Please forgive me.

27:51.640 --> 27:53.350
Thank you for always treating me kindly

27:53.350 --> 27:54.960
and for helping me bury my father.

27:54.960 --> 27:55.880
My husband and I

27:56.270 --> 27:58.600
will repay your kindness in our next life.

28:02.480 --> 28:03.030
Fine.

28:03.680 --> 28:06.160
One of you chooses loyalty,
the other chooses love.

28:06.160 --> 28:08.090
But have you thought about others?

28:09.960 --> 28:11.360
Who are you referring to?

28:11.880 --> 28:13.070
Your brothers.

28:15.240 --> 28:16.700
What are you trying to say?

28:16.880 --> 28:18.480
They've never been princes,

28:19.200 --> 28:21.400
nor lived in a mansion as large as yours.

28:21.640 --> 28:24.040
What do you think
they're eating right now?

28:24.750 --> 28:25.750
I doubt they're willing

28:25.750 --> 28:27.110
to die with you.

28:31.920 --> 28:32.880
Do you know

28:33.480 --> 28:35.010
what you're talking about?

28:35.710 --> 28:37.970
We're all born and raised by our parents.

28:38.160 --> 28:39.420
As long as a man can fill his stomach,

28:39.420 --> 28:41.020
who would choose rebellion?

28:41.830 --> 28:42.480
Yes.

28:43.030 --> 28:44.430
You chose righteousness

28:44.680 --> 28:45.590
and loyalty—

28:46.440 --> 28:47.840
but did you ever ask them?

28:48.370 --> 28:50.150
Do you dare ask them this question

28:50.150 --> 28:51.030
and let those who don't want to follow you

28:51.030 --> 28:52.550
leave the city with me,

28:52.910 --> 28:54.310
leaving you to die alone?

28:58.410 --> 29:01.110
Anyone who disrupts the army's morale
before battle

29:01.110 --> 29:02.370
deserves execution.

29:02.830 --> 29:03.970
Don't hurt Gu.

29:04.110 --> 29:05.360
Why did you say that?

29:05.440 --> 29:06.030
Leave now!

29:06.030 --> 29:07.430
Did I say anything wrong?

29:08.120 --> 29:09.280
Your lives matter,

29:09.440 --> 29:10.740
but theirs don't?

29:11.550 --> 29:12.750
If you can't accept that,

29:12.750 --> 29:13.650
then kill me!

29:13.790 --> 29:14.310
Guards!

29:14.440 --> 29:15.070
Yes!

29:15.550 --> 29:16.200
Honey!

29:16.550 --> 29:17.160
Honey!

29:18.550 --> 29:19.440
Pass my order.

29:19.900 --> 29:21.640
I'll address the troops before the battle.

29:21.640 --> 29:22.400
-Yes!
-Yes!

29:24.750 --> 29:25.820
Come with me.

29:26.610 --> 29:27.440
I'll show you

29:27.480 --> 29:29.160
if any of my men are cowards.

29:41.450 --> 29:44.110
[Li]

29:47.320 --> 29:48.720
Heaven soldiers have descended!

29:48.720 --> 29:50.460
Peace will come to all lands!

29:50.470 --> 29:55.740
[Li]

29:50.550 --> 29:52.110
Heaven soldiers have descended!

29:52.110 --> 29:53.730
Peace will come to all lands!

29:53.920 --> 29:55.580
Heaven soldiers have descended!

29:55.580 --> 29:57.500
Peace will come to all lands!

30:02.650 --> 30:04.750
[Weiwu Gate]

30:06.970 --> 30:08.630
I joined the Resistance Army when I was 6.

30:07.210 --> 30:09.580
[Weiwu Gate]

30:09.540 --> 30:11.420
Back then my brothers asked me,

30:12.270 --> 30:14.210
"Why do farmers toil all year"

30:14.950 --> 30:17.660
"only to starve by the roadside?"

30:19.400 --> 30:21.460
"Why do laborers
work themselves to the bone"

30:21.460 --> 30:22.790
"only for their bodies"

30:23.310 --> 30:25.840
"to be thrown into the fields
as fertilizer?"

30:27.180 --> 30:33.620
[Weiwu Gate]

30:27.370 --> 30:29.710
The officials and nobles of this world

30:30.110 --> 30:31.510
lie to us

30:32.070 --> 30:33.730
and whip us with their lashes.

30:34.440 --> 30:36.130
They oppress our parents,

30:36.250 --> 30:37.770
abuse our children,

30:39.240 --> 30:40.790
and drain us completely.

30:42.540 --> 30:43.740
In a world like this—

30:44.420 --> 30:45.750
how could we not rise up?

30:45.770 --> 30:46.710
[Weiwu Gate]

30:46.920 --> 30:48.590
Kill!

30:48.590 --> 30:50.270
Kill!

30:50.350 --> 30:54.070
Kill!

30:54.270 --> 30:56.000
Kill!

31:01.460 --> 31:03.120
Many of you are my old brothers

31:04.030 --> 31:05.750
who came from Guangxi.

31:07.200 --> 31:08.000
And some of you

31:08.790 --> 31:10.590
joined us in the past year or two.

31:12.240 --> 31:12.980
Now we're trapped here

31:12.980 --> 31:14.570
in Hefei

31:14.960 --> 31:16.020
with nowhere to go.

31:18.400 --> 31:20.060
The great battle is imminent.

31:20.920 --> 31:22.120
I won't force anyone.

31:23.310 --> 31:24.710
Those who choose to stay,

31:25.360 --> 31:26.820
finish the remaining food

31:26.880 --> 31:28.280
and sharpen your blades.

31:29.070 --> 31:30.130
After we die,

31:30.790 --> 31:32.520
we'll continue to be brothers.

31:38.480 --> 31:40.080
Those who don't wish to stay—

31:41.910 --> 31:42.980
tomorrow morning

31:43.680 --> 31:45.740
the Qing Army will pull back 10 miles.

31:46.830 --> 31:48.960
They've sent a Pacification Commissioner.

31:48.960 --> 31:49.960
You can go with him

31:51.000 --> 31:51.930
and return home.

31:53.270 --> 31:54.870
No one is allowed to stop you.

31:56.640 --> 31:57.590
Our blades

31:59.000 --> 32:01.130
will never fall upon our own brothers!

32:03.160 --> 32:05.020
Heaven soldiers have descended!

32:05.200 --> 32:06.800
Peace will come to all lands!

32:06.830 --> 32:08.440
Heaven soldiers have descended!

32:08.440 --> 32:10.230
Peace will come to all lands!

32:12.550 --> 32:14.550
Heaven soldiers have descended!

32:14.680 --> 32:16.720
Peace will come to all lands!

32:21.160 --> 32:24.130
[Weiwu Gate]

32:24.170 --> 32:27.890
[Desheng Gate]

32:49.360 --> 32:50.490
Satisfied now?

32:54.790 --> 32:55.350
Would you like to ask

32:55.350 --> 32:57.210
the rest of your brothers as well?

32:59.690 --> 33:00.750
Do you really think

33:00.750 --> 33:02.080
I don't dare to kill you?

33:04.710 --> 33:06.330
Since I left Ningguta,

33:07.070 --> 33:09.270
I've been walking on the edge every day.

33:09.700 --> 33:10.960
If everyone in the city

33:11.510 --> 33:13.310
can be saved because of me today,

33:14.000 --> 33:15.400
my death will be worth it.

33:20.680 --> 33:21.880
Look at these people.

33:23.360 --> 33:24.520
After the war,

33:24.680 --> 33:26.370
[Desheng Gate]

33:24.960 --> 33:27.020
they'll all be farmers without land.

33:27.480 --> 33:29.080
You should be happy for them.

33:30.070 --> 33:32.930
What difference does it make
if they leave the city?

33:34.310 --> 33:35.240
Everyone's fate

33:35.720 --> 33:37.390
is already written by heaven.

33:40.680 --> 33:41.290
Is there really

33:41.290 --> 33:42.690
an all‑powerful heaven?

33:44.400 --> 33:45.460
I don't believe it.

33:46.110 --> 33:47.440
If there really was one,

33:48.110 --> 33:49.350
there'd be no war,

33:50.270 --> 33:51.270
no disasters.

33:55.550 --> 33:56.680
And your rebellion—

33:57.350 --> 33:58.920
was that heaven's idea too?

34:35.550 --> 34:35.960
Sir.

34:36.880 --> 34:38.080
Please invite Mr. Gu.

34:42.960 --> 34:43.820
Mr. Gu, please.

34:50.030 --> 34:51.960
Mr. Gu, you risked your life

34:52.030 --> 34:53.370
for the country.

34:53.510 --> 34:54.360
Thank you for your hard work.

34:54.360 --> 34:55.960
I don't deserve such praise.

34:55.960 --> 34:56.800
These men...

35:06.360 --> 35:08.800
Everyone who has returned
to the rightful side,

35:08.800 --> 35:09.400
listen up!

35:10.190 --> 35:11.390
Lay down your weapons

35:11.670 --> 35:13.070
and gather at the North Camp!

35:13.070 --> 35:14.800
Weren't you supposed to send us home?

35:14.800 --> 35:16.000
We have no weapons left!

35:16.000 --> 35:17.400
What do you need weapons for?

35:17.400 --> 35:19.370
-I want to go home!
-I want to go home!

35:19.370 --> 35:20.940
We want to go home!

35:21.030 --> 35:22.510
I want to go home!

35:22.670 --> 35:24.110
I want to go back!

35:32.880 --> 35:33.280
Sir,

35:33.360 --> 35:33.800
don't!

35:34.480 --> 35:35.670
Don't worry, Mr. Gu.

35:37.440 --> 35:38.840
Since they've already surrendered,

35:38.840 --> 35:40.370
they're still citizens of the Qing Empire.

35:40.370 --> 35:41.370
You can't do this.

35:41.920 --> 35:42.860
You misunderstood.

35:42.860 --> 35:43.510
It's a misunderstanding.

35:43.510 --> 35:44.510
I'll talk to them.

35:50.030 --> 35:51.030
Fellow brothers,

35:51.320 --> 35:53.400
I am Qiao Song, the Governor of Anhui.

35:54.490 --> 35:55.590
Since you've surrendered,

35:55.590 --> 35:57.960
you're still good subjects
of the imperial court.

35:57.960 --> 35:58.620
Therefore,

35:58.710 --> 36:01.030
we've cleared out the North Camp
to house you.

36:01.030 --> 36:01.650
First,

36:01.710 --> 36:03.110
you've been under siege too long.

36:03.110 --> 36:04.480
Your bodies are weak

36:04.630 --> 36:06.000
and need food.

36:06.400 --> 36:07.000
Second,

36:07.230 --> 36:08.440
you need to shave your heads.

36:08.440 --> 36:08.880
Third,

36:09.150 --> 36:11.030
you need to
change out of your military uniforms.

36:11.030 --> 36:12.320
The area around for hundreds of miles

36:12.320 --> 36:13.800
is filled with
the imperial court's troops.

36:13.800 --> 36:15.530
You can't just go out like this.

36:16.110 --> 36:17.110
If you think

36:17.150 --> 36:18.930
I have any ulterior motives...

36:19.510 --> 36:20.190
Come on.

36:20.630 --> 36:21.690
Put down your guns!

36:21.960 --> 36:22.880
Clear the way!

36:23.400 --> 36:25.330
If anyone still wants to leave,

36:25.590 --> 36:26.400
I...

36:27.150 --> 36:28.880
will respectfully see you off.

36:35.230 --> 36:36.360
Let's go, brothers!

36:37.110 --> 36:38.280
The food is ready!

36:38.880 --> 36:40.090
The water is boiling!

36:40.920 --> 36:41.720
After eating,

36:42.250 --> 36:43.760
you can bathe and get a shave.

36:43.760 --> 36:46.220
Tomorrow,
you'll all get your travel money!

36:46.440 --> 36:47.030
Let's go!

36:47.920 --> 36:48.440
Come on.

36:48.630 --> 36:49.830
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

36:55.150 --> 36:55.830
Gu.

36:55.960 --> 36:56.420
Come on.

36:56.550 --> 36:57.320
Let's go for a drink.

36:57.320 --> 36:57.840
Sir,

36:57.880 --> 37:00.340
I apologize
for my offensive words earlier.

37:00.360 --> 37:01.760
Now you're being too formal with me.

37:01.760 --> 37:03.440
Gu, your loyalty and bravery
are unmatched.

37:03.440 --> 37:05.150
Alone, risking your life,

37:05.230 --> 37:07.510
you rescued
so many civilians and soldiers.

37:07.510 --> 37:09.590
I've already had the adviser
draft a memorial

37:09.590 --> 37:12.120
and rush it to the throne
to report your merit.

37:12.760 --> 37:13.450
Yes.

37:13.840 --> 37:15.320
The Empress Dowager and Sixth Prince

37:15.320 --> 37:16.760
will be very pleased when they see it.

37:16.760 --> 37:18.880
You'll certainly be promoted.

37:19.030 --> 37:20.290
We must have

37:20.360 --> 37:22.220
a preemptive celebration drink.

37:22.710 --> 37:23.800
That won't be necessary.

37:23.800 --> 37:24.280
Let's go.

37:24.280 --> 37:24.710
Please.

37:24.710 --> 37:25.480
Please.

37:37.590 --> 37:38.450
Your Highness.

37:42.190 --> 37:43.840
Who allowed the Princess Consort
to come up?

37:43.840 --> 37:44.840
Don't blame them.

37:45.030 --> 37:46.230
I insisted on coming.

37:49.070 --> 37:49.920
Stand back.

37:54.850 --> 37:56.090
I'll keep you company.

37:56.090 --> 37:57.750
What were you thinking about?

38:01.670 --> 38:02.670
I was thinking...

38:03.630 --> 38:05.030
if we weren't in wartime,

38:05.360 --> 38:06.190
you and I

38:06.230 --> 38:08.710
standing up here on the city wall
enjoying the view

38:08.710 --> 38:09.840
would be wonderful.

38:12.760 --> 38:14.040
If there were no war,

38:14.110 --> 38:15.800
you'd still be mining coal in Guangxi.

38:15.800 --> 38:17.200
I wouldn't even know you.

38:18.190 --> 38:18.710
Yes.

38:19.070 --> 38:19.920
Perhaps

38:20.110 --> 38:22.170
you've already married Gu Pingyuan.

38:23.400 --> 38:24.000
What?

38:24.590 --> 38:26.190
Are you still angry with him?

38:26.630 --> 38:29.830
A real man distinguishes
between gratitude and grudges.

38:30.190 --> 38:31.500
He treated you well.

38:31.920 --> 38:33.450
Even though he offended me,

38:33.550 --> 38:35.080
I won't hold it against him.

38:36.960 --> 38:38.370
This Gu—

38:38.440 --> 38:40.320
he's first‑class
in both character and ability.

38:40.320 --> 38:41.150
I'm just worried

38:41.150 --> 38:43.230
that being around those corrupt officials,

38:43.230 --> 38:45.890
he'll get himself into trouble
sooner or later.

38:46.070 --> 38:47.000
What do you mean?

38:49.000 --> 38:49.930
Never mind.

38:50.190 --> 38:52.590
Not understanding this makes life easier.

38:53.920 --> 38:55.060
I'm just curious.

38:58.150 --> 39:00.150
You still care about him, don't you?

39:03.360 --> 39:03.920
Look.

39:06.400 --> 39:07.190
All those densely packed

39:07.190 --> 39:08.850
Qing troops outside the city—

39:09.400 --> 39:10.670
they know we're short

39:10.710 --> 39:12.150
on food and ammunition—

39:12.960 --> 39:14.850
so why haven't they attacked?

39:16.150 --> 39:18.030
Because they want to make money.

39:19.510 --> 39:21.110
As long as we're still alive,

39:21.510 --> 39:22.580
they can

39:22.670 --> 39:24.670
keep asking the imperial court for men,

39:24.670 --> 39:25.360
money,

39:25.670 --> 39:26.400
and weapons,

39:27.320 --> 39:29.580
and the imperial court will keep giving.

39:29.960 --> 39:31.880
Once the imperial court
can no longer provide,

39:31.880 --> 39:33.080
then they'll attack.

39:33.840 --> 39:35.440
In their eyes, we're nothing

39:35.440 --> 39:37.790
but a tool for promotion and profit.

39:39.950 --> 39:41.880
Gu came to persuade us to surrender

39:42.320 --> 39:44.540
because someone was trying to kill him.

39:45.230 --> 39:46.360
They wanted to use me

39:46.650 --> 39:47.760
to take his life.

39:48.480 --> 39:49.590
There are no good people

39:49.590 --> 39:50.870
around him.

39:53.040 --> 39:53.940
You mean

39:54.710 --> 39:56.400
they sent him here to die?

39:58.630 --> 39:59.700
But Gu is

40:00.670 --> 40:01.900
extremely clever.

40:02.360 --> 40:04.090
He must have seen through this.

40:04.760 --> 40:06.220
That's also his weakness.

40:07.190 --> 40:07.880
What?

40:09.070 --> 40:10.470
Being too kind-hearted.

40:11.510 --> 40:14.370
In these chaotic times,
good people don't survive.

40:18.920 --> 40:19.550
Honey,

40:20.880 --> 40:23.010
it's windy up here. Please go down now.

40:23.400 --> 40:24.030
Guard!

40:24.320 --> 40:26.120
Send the Princess Consort down.

40:26.630 --> 40:27.070
Yes.

40:45.380 --> 40:46.890
They're about to attack.

41:15.660 --> 41:16.570
Brothers!

41:17.150 --> 41:18.550
There's food, brothers!

41:21.920 --> 41:23.180
Don't rush, brothers!

41:23.230 --> 41:24.760
There are stir-fried dishes over there!

41:24.760 --> 41:25.600
And wine too!

41:26.480 --> 41:27.410
There's plenty!

41:28.280 --> 41:29.480
Don't fight over it! Don't fight over it!

41:29.480 --> 41:30.110
There's enough for everyone!

41:30.110 --> 41:31.120
Don't rush!

41:31.960 --> 41:33.160
Slow down! Slow down!

41:34.550 --> 41:35.910
Give me one! Give me one!

41:51.440 --> 41:52.320
Mr. Gu.

41:55.670 --> 41:56.400
Mr. Gu.

41:58.360 --> 41:59.360
Mr. Gu!

42:00.320 --> 42:01.930
You deserve the most credit!

42:04.400 --> 42:05.130
A toast to you

42:05.150 --> 42:06.660
from the two of us.

42:06.920 --> 42:08.360
-Here.
-Fill it up.

42:08.960 --> 42:10.440
-Fill it up.
-Sirs,

42:10.480 --> 42:12.070
I really can't handle alcohol.

42:12.070 --> 42:13.320
Please stop forcing me to drink.

42:13.320 --> 42:14.000
Alright.

42:14.190 --> 42:16.440
Gu, that's absolutely unacceptable.

42:18.230 --> 42:19.110
Come on.

42:21.440 --> 42:21.920
Come on.

42:23.880 --> 42:25.260
If I give you one reason,

42:25.400 --> 42:26.710
I can skip this drink.

42:28.590 --> 42:29.800
What is it?

42:31.360 --> 42:31.920
When you

42:31.960 --> 42:33.490
sent me into the city today,

42:33.800 --> 42:35.270
you didn't think

42:35.290 --> 42:37.350
I wouldn't make it back alive, right?

42:51.570 --> 42:52.540
Mr. Gu,

42:53.320 --> 42:54.920
what makes you say that?

42:57.830 --> 42:59.640
What qualifications do I have

42:59.670 --> 43:01.440
to be this Pacification Commissioner?
